@union_work
title: Work in the unions
subtitle: Strengthen the party's position in the union leadership. · dev: workers_kpd +3×m, kf_right_strength +3
unavailable-subtitle: [? if walcher_timer > 0 : [+ walcher_timer +] months before this adviser can act again. ?]
